        "action": "filed",
        "issue": "TEAM-ORIENTATION-RESEAL-001",
        "reason": "Filed this iteration with the measured round cost. The immediate mitigation is a brief instruction Arch can apply at once; the stronger automatic variant needs a historical rate survey first, which does not belong inside a scientific iteration."
      },
      {
        "problem": 1,
