        "reason": "Deliberately recorded under the existing owner rather than given a near-duplicate category, because it is the same root behaviour and splitting it would dodge the recurrence gate this machinery exists to trip."
      }
    ],
    "carry_forward": [
      "Shape any long-output assignment so each completed unit is written to disk before the next begins; a single terminal Write turns any bound into total loss.",
      "When an assignment will modify a target chosen for its orientation, require the implementer to re-navigate and recompute the candidate signature as the last step before reporting, rather than spending a correction round on the reseal.",
      "Pace a dispatch by its per-turn call cap, not only by the clock: the default cap of 60 cut a turn at 48 calls after only 8.8 minutes, so raise it explicitly when the work needs more."
